  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - \r\n1/ The proposed single storey rear extension would, by reason of its size, position and appearance in relation to the original house, and  neighbouring residential properties, be unduly obtrusive, detrimental to the amenities of adjoining occupiers and is contrary to the Policies ENV-B 1.1 (New Development) and H.6.4 Extensions and Alterations) of the  Unitary Development Plan, and Supplementary Planning Guidance, Residential Extension Guidelines.     \r\n\r\n2/ The proposed single storey rear extension would, by reason of its appearance  in relation to the original house and neighbouring residential properties, not serve to preserve or enhance the character of the St Paul's Conservation Area and is contrary to the Policies  ENV-B 2.2 (Conservation Areas) of the  Unitary Development Plan.     \r\n\r\n\r\n"
